Package: sg-mail
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, thunderbird (>= 1:128)
Recommends: fonts-inter
Description: SG Mail: mail and calendar for Stained Glass OS (built on Thunderbird)
 SG Mail is Stained Glass OS's mail and calendar program, in a window
 arranged the way many office workers know: a ribbon, the folder pane with
 Favorites and unread counts, the message list grouped by date, the reading
 pane, a message window, and a calendar with Day, Work Week, Week and Month
 views, meeting invitations and reminders.
 .
 It is built on Mozilla Thunderbird (Debian's thunderbird package,
 unmodified), which does the work underneath: IMAP, POP and SMTP accounts,
 sign-in to Microsoft (Outlook.com, Microsoft 365) and Google accounts on
 their own login pages, autoconfiguration from the address, the calendar
 (local, CalDAV and Internet calendars), the address book and offline
 storage. SG Mail runs Thunderbird with a profile of its own (sg-mail) and
 makes its main window SG Mail's with a Thunderbird extension.
